flowchart LR
  USER((사용자\n팀장 · 팀원))

  subgraph FE[Frontend · Next.js / React]
    UI[화면\n대시보드 · 문서 · 업무 · 승인]
    CLIENT[API Client\nJWT · DTO · Error]
    UI --> CLIENT
  end

  subgraph APP[Backend App · Django / DRF]
    API[REST API Gateway\nSimpleJWT · OpenAPI]
    MEETING[회의록]
    PLAN[기획서]
    REQUIREMENT[요구사항]
    TASK[업무 생성]
    ASSIGN[담당자 추천·승인]
    API --> MEETING --> PLAN --> REQUIREMENT --> TASK --> ASSIGN
  end

  subgraph AITIER[Async & AI]
    CELERY[Celery Worker]
    LANGGRAPH[LangGraph\n문서 자동화 · RAG]
    LLM[LLM Provider\nAnthropic / OpenAI]
    CELERY --> LANGGRAPH --> LLM
  end

  subgraph DATA[Data Stores]
    RDB[(MySQL / RDS\n업무 데이터)]
    S3[(AWS S3\n원본 · 산출물)]
    QDRANT[(Qdrant\nVector)]
    REDIS[(Redis\nQueue · Cache)]
  end

  subgraph OPS[Operations]
    GIT[GitHub · Actions]
    DEPLOY[Docker · AWS]
    OBS[LangSmith · Logs · Monitoring]
    GIT --> DEPLOY --> OBS
  end

  USER -->|HTTPS| UI
  CLIENT -->|REST JSON + Bearer JWT| API
  API -.->|OpenAPI Schema| CLIENT
  PLAN -.->|AI Job| CELERY
  REQUIREMENT -.->|AI Job| CELERY
  TASK -.->|AI Job| CELERY
  CELERY <--> REDIS
  LANGGRAPH --> RDB
  LANGGRAPH --> S3
  LANGGRAPH <--> QDRANT
  ASSIGN --> RDB
  OBS -.-> APP
  OBS -.-> AITIER

